      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This bug was originally reported as the original ticket, but further testing w/ Vowgan has exposed a lot of oddity. I'm thinking the main bug I've found is that FlagDiscontinuity seems to be able to cause a significant desync problem. But we really need better control over sync, or at least more understanding of what triggers a sync being Important or not.",
